Prototype an optional server-owned same-origin next page path on
MemoryDownload. The identity success writer emits it as an RFC 8288 next
Link before the attachment. The distribution handler derives it from
the cursor belonging to the exact serialized page. Preserve the validated
query parameters and rebuild the public path with cellroute.Public. The
prototype is an isolated Go overlay and does not change ownership of the
shared HTTP type or writer.
